{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not ignore failed MDC restoration on inline executors.** When restoration throws a `RuntimeException`, the result has already been completed; a direct executor rethrows into this catch, which then ignores the failure. The caller returns with ambient MDC deleted or handler/plugin fields leaked. Publish the result only after successful restoration, or retry/propagate the restoration failure, and assert the caller\u2019s MDC after the injected failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77INYE","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":269,"observation_digest":"9baf211bd4737115abc23e115a4fee6e96d66a50d91b02aabdcb1fdaff2814dd","observation_id":"aro_v1_toxscg6uonyrlk6chyivut7on2","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ahpygitvijm2xuf5p2wjqxp4wv","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"dceb158abc6b47b3cbbdc07b99e5d70e670f4826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":269,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_wgd73buwmef4zgddsgp7pxlwn3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
